{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8c3db44f5f831f1d","name":"Shockboxing Gloves","source":{"id":"source:reference-8c3db44f5f831f1d","title":"Shockboxing Gloves","revision":20947,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:51:39Z","sha256":"07d789792db724669cec08090d7db52edb251fdfe4c72b50a065d5cd54df9ec9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20947","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shockboxing%20Gloves&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8c3db44f5f831f1d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Shockboxing Gloves are powered gauntlets worn during a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shockboxing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shockboxing","referenceId":"reference:9e155f6537d75d18"}," match. Shockboxing Gloves protect the wearer's hands and also deal damage to any character hit by them. Shockboxing Gloves are similar to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:bad45a025bb351a0"},". However, unlike a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:bad45a025bb351a0"},", Shockboxing Gloves have various settings, from lethal to a light shock (for sparring) as well as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," setting.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Shockboxing Gloves provide a +1 bonus to damage with a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},". They can be set to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", converting the wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," damage to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage (and providing the +1 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage). Shockboxing Gloves are two sizes smaller than their wearer (for example, a pair of Shockboxing Gloves designed for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," are Tiny). Because of how they are worn, Shockboxing Gloves can't be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarmed"}," or dropped.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Small Shockboxing Gloves"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Diminutive\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," +1 to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.4 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning and Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Medium Shockboxing Gloves"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 600\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," +1 to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning and Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
